NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000473 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000474 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000475 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000476 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000477 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000478 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000479 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000480 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000481 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000482 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000483 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000484 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000485 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000486 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000487 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000488 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000489 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
